MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

hideFromCaster only ran from "no possible targets", i.e. when no enemy was in sight, so it never fired in combat.
A new "exposed to enemy caster" trigger (500 ms) runs ArenaTactics::takeCover: healers always hide, ranged damage
dealers when shot at or below 50%, melee circle their target to the side a pillar shields. The cover point must stay
in sight of the own healer (for a healer, of the teammate lowest on health). After hiding, the bot holds cover 3-4 s
instead of walking straight back out to its target.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vn4vD1fiBmsMGCCvsiqU7z
